@startuml lta-stac

actor John
collections RS_Server_LTA
activate RS_Server_LTA

note over John, RS_Server_LTA: John has access to 2 LTA services: lta_acri and lta_werum

John -> RS_Server_LTA: GET /lta
RS_Server_LTA --> John: STAC landing page

John -> RS_Server_LTA: GET /lta/collections
RS_Server_LTA --> John: {S1A_L1_EW_SLC, S1A_L1_IW_SLC, S1A_L1_SM_SLC, S1C_L1_EW_SLC, S1C_L1_IW_SLC, S1C_L1_SM_SLC}

newpage

John -> RS_Server_LTA: GET /lta/collections/S1A_L1_IW_SLC/items
RS_Server_LTA -> lta_acri ++ : GET Products?$filter=Attributes/OData.CSC.StringAttribute/any(\natt:att/Name eq 'productType' and\natt/OData.CSC.StringAttribute/Value eq 'IW_SLC__1S')\n&$expand=Attributes&$orderby=PublicationDate desc
lta_acri --> RS_Server_LTA : <OData response/>
RS_Server_LTA -> RS_Server_LTA : OData > STAC mapping
RS_Server_LTA --> John : {STAC response}

John -> RS_Server_LTA: GET /lta/collections/S1C_L1_IW_SLC/items
RS_Server_LTA -> lta_werum ++ : GET Products?$filter=Attributes/OData.CSC.StringAttribute/any(\natt:att/Name eq 'productType' and\natt/OData.CSC.StringAttribute/Value eq 'IW_SLC__1S')\n&$expand=Attributes&$orderby=PublicationDate desc
lta_werum --> RS_Server_LTA : <OData response/>
RS_Server_LTA -> RS_Server_LTA : OData > STAC mapping
RS_Server_LTA --> John : {STAC response}

newpage

John -> RS_Server_LTA: POST /lta/search?platform=sentinel-1a
RS_Server_LTA -> lta_acri : GET Products?$filter=Attributes/OData.CSC.StringAttribute/any(\natt:att/Name eq 'platformShortName' and\natt/OData.CSC.StringAttribute/Value eq 'SENTINEL-1') and any(\natt:att/Name eq 'platformSerialIdentifier' and\natt/OData.CSC.StringAttribute/Value eq 'A')\n&$expand=Attributes&$orderby=PublicationDate desc
RS_Server_LTA -> lta_werum : GET Products?$filter=Attributes/OData.CSC.StringAttribute/any(\natt:att/Name eq 'platformShortName' and\natt/OData.CSC.StringAttribute/Value eq 'SENTINEL-1') and any(\natt:att/Name eq 'platformSerialIdentifier' and\natt/OData.CSC.StringAttribute/Value eq 'A')\n&$expand=Attributes&$orderby=PublicationDate desc
RS_Server_LTA -> RS_Server_LTA : OData > STAC mapping
RS_Server_LTA --> John : {STAC response}

newpage

John -> RS_Server_LTA: GET /lta/queryables
RS_Server_LTA --> John: {platform}

@enduml
